('kinra-band-full-body','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Band full body · 3 days","description":"Light portable resistance with a manufacturer-approved anchor. Alternate controlled leg, push and pull work.\n\nRepeat the listed week. Begin at the low end of each rep range with 3–4 reps in reserve (RPE 6–7). Add one rep per set when controlled; after every set reaches the top, increase the smallest available load and return to the low end. Do not increase load and sets together. If recovery or form worsens, repeat the previous week or remove one set.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0518-resistance-band-curl","name":"Resistance Band Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."}]},{"title":"B · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0525-resistance-band-lat-pulldown","name":"Resistance Band Lat Pulldown","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0528-resistance-band-leg-curl","name":"Resistance Band Leg Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0527-resistance-band-lateral-raise","name":"Resistance Band Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."}]},{"title":"C · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0533-resistance-band-triceps-pushdown","name":"Resistance Band Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Cijelo tijelo s trakom · 3 dana","description":"Lagani prenosivi otpor sa sidrom koje odobrava proizvođač. Smjenjujte kontrolisani rad za noge, potiske i povlačenja.\n\nPonavljajte prikazanu sedmicu. Počnite donjim brojem ponavljanja uz 3–4 ponavljanja u rezervi (RPE 6–7). Dodajte po jedno kontrolisano ponavljanje u seriji; kada sve serije dostignu gornju granicu, dodajte najmanje dostupno opterećenje i vratite se donjoj. Ne povećavajte istovremeno opterećenje i broj serija. Ako oporavak ili tehnika oslabe, ponovite prethodnu sedmicu ili uklonite jednu seriju.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0518-resistance-band-curl","name":"Resistance Band Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite s