 Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0266-flat-machine-chest-press-wide-grip","name":"Flat Machine Chest Press (Wide Grip)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]},{"title":"B · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0228-dumbbell-lunges-iskoraci-s-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Lunges (Iskoraci s bučicama)","sets":3,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0224-dumbbell-glute-bridge","name":"Dumbbell Glute Bridge","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0218-dumbbell-biceps-curl","name":"Dumbbell Biceps Curl","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]},{"title":"C · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0628-single-arm-dumbbell-row-jednoruko-veslanje-bucicom","name":"Single-Arm Dumbbell Row (Jednoruko veslanje bučicom)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0676-standing-cable-chest-press","name":"Standing Cable Chest Press","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0554-rope-triceps-pushdown","name":"Rope Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-lower-focus','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Lower-body focus · 2 days","description":"Two leg-focused sessions for an existing balanced schedule. Add your reviewed upper-body sessions; this is not a full-body week.\n\nRepeat the listed week. Begin at the low end of each rep range with 3–4 reps in reserve (RPE 6–7). Add one rep per set when controlled; after every set reaches the top, increase the smallest available load and return to the low end. Do not increase load and sets together. If recovery or form worsens, repeat the previous week or remove one set.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Lower","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0549-romanian-deadlift","name":"Romanian Deadlift","sets":3,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0392-leg-extension-machine","name":"Leg Extension (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0575-seated-calf-raise","name":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"B · Lower","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0094-bulgarian-split-squat","name":"Bulgarian Split Squat","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0679-standing-calf-raise-machine","name":"Standing Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Fokus na donji dio · 2 dana","description":"Dva treninga nogu kao dio postojećeg uravnoteženog rasporeda. Dodajte pregledane treninge gornjeg dijela; ovo nije sedmica za cijelo tijelo.\n\nPonavljajte prikazanu sedmicu. Počnite donjim brojem ponavljanja uz 3–4 ponavljanja u rezervi (RPE 6–7). Dodajte po jedno kontrolisano ponavljanje u seriji; kada sve serije dostignu gornju granicu, dodajte najmanje dostupno opterećenje i vratite se donjoj. Ne povećavajte istovremeno opterećenje i broj serija. Ako oporavak ili tehnika oslabe, ponovite prethodnu sedmicu ili uklonite jednu seriju.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Donji dio","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0549-romanian-deadlift","name":"Romanian Deadlift","sets":3,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0392-leg-extension-machine","name":"Leg Extension (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0575-seated-calf-raise","name":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"B · Donji dio","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0094-bulgarian-split-squat","name":"Bulgarian Split Squat","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0679-standing-calf-raise-machine","name":"Standing Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Unterkörper-Fokus · 2 Tage","description":"Zwei Beineinheiten als Teil eines ausgewogenen Plans. Geprüfte Oberkörpereinheiten ergänzen; dies ist keine Ganzkörperwoche.\n\nDie angegebene Woche wiederholen. Am unteren Ende des Wiederholungsbereichs mit 3–4 Wiederholungen Reserve (RPE 6–7) beginnen. Bei guter Kontrolle eine Wiederholung pro Satz ergänzen; erreichen alle Sätze die Obergrenze, das kleinste verfügbare Gewicht hinzufügen und unten beginnen. Gewicht und Satzzahl nicht gleichzeitig erhöhen. Bei schlechterer Erholung oder Technik die Vorwoche wiederholen oder einen Satz streichen.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Unterkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0549-romanian-deadlift","name":"Romanian Deadlift","sets":3,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0392-leg-extension-machine","name":"Leg Extension (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0575-seated-calf-raise","name":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"B · Unterkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0094-bulgarian-split-squat","name":"Bulgarian Split Squat","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0679-standing-calf-raise-machine","name":"Standing Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-upper-focus','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Upper-body focus · 2 days","description":"Two complementary push/pull sessions for an existing balanced schedule. Add reviewed lower-body work.\n\nRepeat the listed week. Begin at the low end of each rep range with 3–4 reps in reserve (RPE 6–7). Add one rep per set when controlled; after every set reaches the top, increase the smallest available load and return to the low end. Do not increase load and sets together. If recovery or form worsens, repeat the previous week or remove one set.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Upper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0554-rope-triceps-pushdown","name":"Rope Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."}]},{"title":"B · Upper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0330-incline-bench-press-kosi-potisak-gornji-dio-prsa","name":"Incline Bench Press (Kosi potisak — gornji dio prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0152-chest-supported-row-veslanje-s-osloncem-na-prsa","name":"Chest Supported Row (Veslanje s osloncem na prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0218-dumbbell-biceps-curl","name":"Dumbbell Biceps Curl","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Fokus na gornji dio · 2 dana","description":"Dva komplementarna treninga potiska i povlačenja u postojećem uravnoteženom rasporedu. Dodajte pregledan rad za donji dio.\n\nPonavljajte prikazanu sedmicu. Počnite donjim brojem ponavljanja uz 3–4 ponavljanja u rezervi (RPE 6–7). Dodajte po jedno kontrolisano ponavljanje u seriji; kada sve serije dostignu gornju granicu, dodajte najmanje dostupno opterećenje i vratite se donjoj. Ne povećavajte istovremeno opterećenje i broj serija. Ako oporavak ili tehnika oslabe, ponovite prethodnu sedmicu ili uklonite jednu seriju.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Gornji dio","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0554-rope-triceps-pushdown","name":"Rope Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."}]},{"title":"B · Gornji dio","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0330-incline-bench-press-kosi-potisak-gornji-dio-prsa","name":"Incline Bench Press (Kosi potisak — gornji dio prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0152-chest-supported-row-veslanje-s-osloncem-na-prsa","name":"Chest Supported Row (Veslanje s osloncem na prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0218-dumbbell-biceps-curl","name":"Dumbbell Biceps Curl","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Oberkörper-Fokus · 2 Tage","description":"Zwei ergänzende Druck-/Zugeinheiten in einem ausgewogenen Plan. Geprüftes Unterkörpertraining ergänzen.\n\nDie angegebene Woche wiederholen. Am unteren Ende des Wiederholungsbereichs mit 3–4 Wiederholungen Reserve (RPE 6–7) beginnen. Bei guter Kontrolle eine Wiederholung pro Satz ergänzen; erreichen alle Sätze die Obergrenze, das kleinste verfügbare Gewicht hinzufügen und unten beginnen. Gewicht und Satzzahl nicht gleichzeitig erhöhen. Bei schlechterer Erholung oder Technik die Vorwoche wiederholen oder einen Satz streichen.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Oberkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0554-rope-triceps-pushdown","name":"Rope Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]},{"title":"B · Oberkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0330-incline-bench-press-kosi-potisak-gornji-dio-prsa","name":"Incline Bench Press (Kosi potisak — gornji dio prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0152-chest-supported-row-veslanje-s-osloncem-na-prsa","name":"Chest Supported Row (Veslanje s osloncem na prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0227-dumbbell-lateral-raise","name":"Dumbbell Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0218-dumbbell-biceps-curl","name":"Dumbbell Biceps Curl","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-easy-restart','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Easy restart · 2 days","description":"A small, low-effort starting week for adults returning after an ordinary break. This is not rehabilitation or a post-illness clearance plan.\n\nWeek 1: use one easy set per exercise with about 5 reps in reserve (RPE 5). If comfortable and recovered, use two sets in week 2 and keep them through weeks 3–4. Add reps within the range before adding load. Reassess before moving to a larger routine.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":4,"days":[{"title":"A · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0266-flat-machine-chest-press-wide-grip","name":"Flat Machine Chest Press (Wide Grip)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":1,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"B · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0284-goblet-squat","name":"Goblet Squat","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":1,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0282-glute-bridge-most-straznjice","name":"Glute Bridge (Most stražnjice)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Lagani povratak · 2 dana","description":"Kratka početna sedmica manjeg napora za odrasle nakon uobičajene pauze. Ovo nije rehabilitacija niti plan povratka nakon bolesti.\n\nPrva sedmica: jedna lagana serija uz oko 5 ponavljanja u rezervi (RPE 5). Ako vam odgovara i oporavljeni ste, u drugoj sedmici radite dvije serije i zadržite ih do četvrte. Dodajte ponavljanja unutar raspona prije opterećenja. Ponovo procijenite prije većeg plana.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":4,"days":[{"title":"A · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0266-flat-machine-chest-press-wide-grip","name":"Flat Machine Chest Press (Wide Grip)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":1,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"B · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0284-goblet-squat","name":"Goblet Squat","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":1,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0282-glute-bridge-most-straznjice","name":"Glute Bridge (Most stražnjice)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Leichter Wiedereinstieg · 2 Tage","description":"Eine kleine Einstiegswoche mit geringer Anstrengung nach einer gewöhnlichen Pause. Kein Rehabilitations- oder Freigabeplan nach Krankheit.\n\nWoche 1: ein leichter Satz je Übung mit etwa 5 Wiederholungen Reserve (RPE 5). Bei guter Verträglichkeit und Erholung ab Woche 2 zwei Sätze bis Woche 4. Zuerst Wiederholungen im Bereich, dann Gewicht ergänzen. Vor einem größeren Plan neu bewerten.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":4,"days":[{"title":"A · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0266-flat-machine-chest-press-wide-grip","name":"Flat Machine Chest Press (Wide Grip)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":1,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"B · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0284-goblet-squat","name":"Goblet Squat","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":1,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0282-glute-bridge-most-straznjice","name":"Glute Bridge (Most stražnjice)","sets":1,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-bodyweight-build','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Bodyweight build · 3 days","description":"Three sessions for adults comfortable with floor push-ups. Includes a rated fixed bar for rows and a stable low step.\n\nRepeat the week with a rest day between sessions. Add one controlled rep per set up to the upper limit. Then use a slightly harder movement variation only after reviewing it, and restart at the lower limit. Keep 2–4 reps in reserve; extra speed is not progression.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise. Use only a purpose-built, load-rated fixed bar for rows. Review mounting and body position before training; never substitute a table or loose furniture.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0507-push-up-skleka","name":"Push-Up (Skleka)","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"6–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"B · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0691-step-up-korak-na-klupe-stepenice","name":"Step-Up (Korak na klupe/stepenice)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Use a low, stable step. Reps are per leg; complete both legs for one set. Do not use an unstable chair."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0462-pike-push-up-skleka-u-v-poziciji","name":"Pike Push-Up (Skleka u V poziciji)","sets":2,"reps":"5–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0633-single-leg-glute-bridge-jednonozni-most","name":"Single-Leg Glute Bridge (Jednonožni most)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"C · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0507-push-up-skleka","name":"Push-Up (Skleka)","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"15–20","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"10","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Napredak vlastitom težinom · 3 dana","description":"Tri treninga za odrasle koji sigurno rade sklekove na podu. Potrebna je čvrsto postavljena prečka za veslanje i niska stabilna stepenica.\n\nPonavljajte sedmicu uz dan odmora između treninga. Dodajte po jedno kontrolisano ponavljanje do gornje granice. Zatim, tek nakon pregleda, odaberite malo težu varijantu i počnite donjim brojem. Zadržite 2–4 ponavljanja u rezervi; veća brzina nije napredak.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje. Za veslanje koristite samo namjensku čvrstu prečku odgovarajuće nosivosti. Provjerite montažu i položaj tijela; ne koristite sto ili labav namještaj.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0507-push-up-skleka","name":"Push-Up (Skleka)","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"6–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"B · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0691-step-up-korak-na-klupe-stepenice","name":"Step-Up (Korak na klupe/stepenice)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Koristite nisku, stabilnu stepenicu. Ponavljanja su po nozi; obje noge čine jednu seriju. Ne koristite nestabilnu stolicu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0462-pike-push-up-skleka-u-v-poziciji","name":"Pike Push-Up (Skleka u V poziciji)","sets":2,"reps":"5–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0633-single-leg-glute-bridge-jednonozni-most","name":"Single-Leg Glute Bridge (Jednonožni most)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"C · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0507-push-up-skleka","name":"Push-Up (Skleka)","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"15–20","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"10","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Körpergewicht-Aufbau · 3 Tage","description":"Drei Einheiten für Erwachsene mit sicherem Liegestütz am Boden. Mit belastbarer fester Ruderstange und stabiler niedriger Stufe.\n\nDie Woche mit einem Ruhetag zwischen Einheiten wiederholen. Kontrollierte Wiederholungen bis zur Obergrenze ergänzen. Danach erst nach Prüfung eine etwas schwierigere Variante wählen und unten beginnen. 2–4 Wiederholungen Reserve lassen; höheres Tempo ist kein Fortschrittskriterium.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen. Für Rudern nur eine dafür vorgesehene, belastbare feste Stange verwenden. Montage und Körperposition prüfen; keinen Tisch oder lose Möbel ersetzen.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0507-push-up-skleka","name":"Push-Up (Skleka)","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"6–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"B · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0691-step-up-korak-na-klupe-stepenice","name":"Step-Up (Korak na klupe/stepenice)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Eine niedrige, stabile Stufe nutzen. Wiederholungen pro Bein; beide Beine ergeben einen Satz. Keinen instabilen Stuhl verwenden."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0462-pike-push-up-skleka-u-v-poziciji","name":"Pike Push-Up (Skleka u V poziciji)","sets":2,"reps":"5–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0633-single-leg-glute-bridge-jednonozni-most","name":"Single-Leg Glute Bridge (Jednonožni most)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"C · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0507-push-up-skleka","name":"Push-Up (Skleka)","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0345-inverted-row-obrnuto-veslanje-ispod-precke","name":"Inverted Row (Obrnuto veslanje — ispod prečke)","sets":3,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"15–20","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"10","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
